  "note": "Patcher matrix for B194, BUILT FROM main AT 3551bd9 (PRs #366, #367), seeded from the B193 matrix. Two owner-requested changes over B193. (1) Spa Lounger drop degrade DOCUMENTED, no behaviour change: a villager dropped on a spa lounger sometimes runs an ordinary chaise relax because both spa loungers share the stock eObjectChaise object and LinkPeepToFurniture can link a different chaise; the degrade is deliberate (the reservation cannot be un-linked) and B194 adds a comment plus a characterization test recording why the obvious re-resolve fix is rejected. Issue #365, PR #366. (2) Achiever Extraordinaire (0x92) now DRAWS as the last Goals row in every runtime state, including with Holiday Furniture enabled: the draw loop walks a display copy (achievementDisplayOrder) that is the visible window with 0x92 pulled to the end, rebuilt each draw for the current runtime holiday state, while the completion scan still reads the real achievementOrder so autocomplete is unchanged. PR #367. See docs/B194-release-notes.md, which must not disagree with this field.",
